# Copy this file to .env and fill in entries as features need them.
# (Runtime WiFi credentials live in NVS on the robot, not here.)
# Shared link secret: exactly 32 hex chars (16 bytes, AES-128), no quotes.
# Firmware builds read it from the environment into DESKY_LINK_SECRET_HEX;
# a missing or misshapen value stops the build at compile time. Native host
# tests never need it. Mint one per unit, e.g.:
# python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(16))"
# DESKY_LINK_SECRET=PASTE_32_HEX_CHARS_HERE
